{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Rodion_KumoThumb_10916.json|/dataList/3/desc","kr_sha":"549f8a0d2fc9a16309b030899a2c8624dea9c87cf93b22d65741f52ee762a4ed","zh":"晚間問候","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Rodion_KumoThumb_10916.json|/dataList/3/dlg","kr_sha":"54c8b8b68dd35b963af917f0162bea84ade408051d77fd5717ace16136f08192","zh":"……什麼啊。已經喝光了？呼……希斯克利夫，從架子上再拿別的酒……搞什麼，這小子跑哪去了？希斯克利夫！！！<color=#8c63c2>您叫我嗎，師父。</color>他媽的，當然是我叫的，難不成是鬼叫你啊？<color=#8c63c2>對不起。</color>嘖，皮鬆了是吧……下次給我馬上滾過來。聽到沒？<color=#8c63c2>是。</color>","origin":"claude","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"43ba181e5a31030c7363467db459fe62c998ea2f","model":"phase1-session","batch":"20261101T074409-49260a1a"}
