{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Rodion_KumoThumb_10916.json|/dataList/4/desc","kr_sha":"43da8f2faf5af065a534f87945d13e2671f10c1f1b86cbf5539f9d5668181a0f","zh":"對話 1","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Rodion_KumoThumb_10916.json|/dataList/4/dlg","kr_sha":"03872d0d1dd97baa3c68bf4b042037b3576e8e09408f60e3a03dfe13dc2e664e","zh":"他媽的……我到現在在門票身上花了多少時間，竟然還要從頭開始教那個小鬼？這像話嗎？\n呼……中央那邊的顧問，那混蛋也沒另外聯絡我。既然連李箱那個死腦筋都說沒問題……嘖，總之先教教看嗎。","origin":"claude","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"43ba181e5a31030c7363467db459fe62c998ea2f","model":"phase1-session","batch":"20261101T074409-49260a1a"}
