{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Rodion_KumoThumb_10916.json|/dataList/5/desc","kr_sha":"ae22d4fc09a33be838e1721a7aa26d5dbd2dd2aab86575413ab771d478069747","zh":"對話 2","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Rodion_KumoThumb_10916.json|/dataList/5/dlg","kr_sha":"68299104e560aa9d3633ba6b4ac91297e0950e78a72807abd144de34dda9c7f3","zh":"她逃跑的時候斬掉了不少東西吧。光是捨不得那些代價，良秀也放不下天殺星刀……那件遺物。\n……嘖。不過，還是留個教材比較好吧。她說不定學了什麼聞所未聞的劍術，或是姿勢已經亂七八糟了。","origin":"claude","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"43ba181e5a31030c7363467db459fe62c998ea2f","model":"phase1-session","batch":"20261101T074409-49260a1a"}
{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Rodion_KumoThumb_10916.json|/dataList/5/id","kr_sha":"37a4181c6d38dcac046e62961175a3226b510809ba89090f0811707aa8d8a631","zh":"smalltalk_10916_2","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Rodion_KumoThumb_10916.json|/dataList/6/desc","kr_sha":"65e016ef58165be68acb39554fb899828842c8c1029509638e067da9d0efde1f","zh":"對話 3","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"PersonalityVoiceDlg/Voice_Rodion_KumoThumb_10916.json|/dataList/6/dlg","kr_sha":"ffbf2a83516ebf3228d4af4ba5919ce15b846ee48fac9b432df636f26d04d525","zh":"等一切結束後，我得從中央那邊的顧問、那混蛋身上把該拿的全討回來。我累死累活吃了這麼多苦，總得有點回報吧。\n把我的階級拿回來，再敲他一筆錢，把門票那半殘的身子也治好……以教材那小子的實力，弄個指揮官的位子應該也不成問題……哈。還不賴嘛。","origin":"claude","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"43ba181e5a31030c7363467db459fe62c998ea2f","model":"phase1-session","batch":"20261101T074409-49260a1a"}
